# assistente utile U8 (docs/plans/assistente-utile.md) — un presupposto che la KB
# non regge si corregge con cio' che si sa, senza negare cio' che non si puo'
# negare; e la coda «…, right?» fa di un'affermazione la domanda polare.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test a wrong capital receives what is known]
!timeout 30
> is rome the capital of france?
<~ Not as far as I know: I know Paris as the capital of France.
> is paris the capital of france?
< Yes.

[test a tag question is the polar question]
!timeout 30
> paris is the capital of spain, right?
<~ I know Madrid as the capital of Spain
> paris is the capital of france, right?
< Yes.
